      "body": "## Motivation\nWith `--fp8-gemm-backend flashinfer_cutlass`, block-fp8 weights served as MXFP8 always use FlashInfer's CUTLASS MXFP8 GEMM. On SM120/SM121, FlashInfer 0.7.2 also ships the b12x warp-MMA backend. It has small-M tiles and is faster at every M. FlashInfer's own `backend=\"auto\"` already prefers it on SM12x.\n\n## Modifications\n`dispatch_block_fp8_mxfp8_linear`: when FlashInfer reports `b12x` as supported for the device, use b12x when K % 128 == 0 and CUTLASS otherwise. Non-SM12x devices are unchanged.\n\n## Accuracy Tests\n- Kernel level: the output error is identical across the Triton block, CUTLASS and b12x paths (rel ≈ 2.67e-2, which comes from activation quantization).\n- GSM8K 5-shot, DeepSeek-V4.1-Flash: 0.913 (b12x) vs 0.904 (CUTLASS); SE ≈ 0.8pt.\n\n## Speed Tests and Profiling\n8x RTX PRO 5000 72GB, DeepSeek-V4.1-Flash, DP8 attention + EP8, MXFP4 MoE.\n\nKernel latency (us, CUDA graph):\n\n| N×K | M | CUTLASS | b12x |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| 1792×5120 | 1 | 33.5 | 7.6 |\n| 25600×6144 | 1 | 420 | 142 |\n| 25600×6144 | 8192 | 9906 | 7207 |\n\nEnd to end, CUTLASS → b12x:\n\n| Metric | CUTLASS | b12x | Change |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| 32K-in/1K-out saturation | 0.766 req/s | 0.801 req/s | +4.6% |\n| 3K-in/100-out saturation | 9.26 req/s | 9.59 req/s | +3.6% |\n| Single-request 32K prefill | 11188 tok/s | 11734 tok/s | +4.9% |\n| bs1 TPOT | 27.3 ms | 18.0 ms | 1.52× |\n\n### Validation of the combined branches\nI validated a clean tree: upstream `a90e9c5d` plus #42371 plus this PR and the three companion SM120 PRs (DeepGEMM metadata, b12x MXFP8, mHC BLOCK_K, RTX PRO 5000 configs). It ran on 8x RTX PRO 5000, DP8 attention + EP8, with `--fp8-gemm-backend flashinfer_cutlass`:\n\n| | GSM8K | 32K/1K req/s | 3K/100 req/s | 32K prefill tok/s | bs1 TPOT |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| clean branches | 0.905 | 0.807 | 9.59 | 12020 | 17.4 ms |\n| env-gated dev build (reference) | 0.913 | 0.801 | 9.59 | 11734 | 18.0 ms |\n\n## Checklist\n- [x] Format with pre-commit\n- [x] Accuracy and speed tests above\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\n<!-- pr-states:start -->\n---\n### CI States\n\nLatest PR Test (Base): <!-- slot:pr-test:start -->:x: [Run #39346501460](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/39346501460)<!-- slot:pr-test:end -->\nLatest PR Test (Extra): <!-- slot:pr-test-extra:start -->:x: [Run #39346501290](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/39346501290)<!-- slot:pr-test-extra:end -->\nLatest PR Test (AMD ROCm 10): <!-- slot:pr-test-amd:start -->:x: [Run #39346501401](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/39346501401)<!-- slot:pr-test-amd:end -->\n<!-- pr-states:end -->",
