  "inline_comments": [],
  "issue_comments": [
    {
      "body": "@BBuf @ch-wan Could you take a look and `/tag-and-rerun-ci` when you get a chance? On SM12x this routes block-fp8-as-MXFP8 linears to FlashInfer's b12x backend (+4-5% e2e throughput, 1.5x bs1 TPOT on RTX PRO 5000); other archs are unchanged. Thanks!",
